05"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,88,19,22,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004902","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,88,19,22,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004902","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,88,19,22,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004902","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,88,19,22,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004902","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10104","city":"CS1013","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,88,19,22,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004902","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将，曹真部下，面黑睛黄，熊腰虎背，擅用一口六十斤的大刀，开两石铁胎弓，暗藏三个流星锤。诸葛亮第二次北伐期间被曹叡封为虎威将军，并作为先锋出军。诸葛亮包围陈仓期间，作为援军支援郝昭，并斩杀蜀将谢雄、龚起，又重创了大将张嶷。后因中诸葛亮诱敌之计追击过深，欲撤退之时被魏延所斩。","tc":"魏國武將，曹真部下，面黑睛黃，熊腰虎背，擅用一口六十斤的大刀，開兩石鐵胎弓，暗藏三個流星錘。諸葛亮第二次北伐期間被曹叡封為虎威將軍，并作為先鋒出軍。諸葛亮包圍陳倉期間，作為援軍支援郝昭，并斬殺蜀將謝雄、龔起，又重創了大將張嶷。后因中諸葛亮誘敵之計追擊過深，欲撤退之時被魏延所斬。","en":"An officer of Wei and subordinate of Cao Zhen. Dark-skinned with yellow eyes, a bear's waist and tiger's back, he wielded a sixty-jin guandao, drew a two-dan iron-backed bow, and concealed three meteor hammers on his person. During Zhuge Liang's second Northern Expedition, he was named General of Tiger Might by Cao Rui and served as vanguard. While Zhuge Liang besieged Chencang, he arrived as reinforcements to support Hao Zhao and slew the Shu officers Xie Xiong and Gong Qi, also badly wounding the general Zhang Ni. He later fell for Zhuge Liang's lure stratagem, pursuing too deep, when he tried to retreat, Wei Yan cut him down.","jp":"魏の武将。曹真の部下。面は黒く眼は黄色く、熊腰虎背の体躯を誇る。六十斤の大刀を振るい、二石の鉄胎弓を引き、三つの流星鎚を隠し持っていた。諸葛亮の第二次北伐の際、曹叡より虎威将軍に任じられ、先鋒として出陣した。諸葛亮が陳倉を包囲した際には援軍として郝昭を救援し、蜀将の謝雄や龔起を討ち取り、大将の張嶷にも重傷を負わせた。後に諸葛亮の誘敵の計に嵌まって深追いし、撤退しようとしたところを魏延に討ち取られた。","kr":"위나라의 무장이자 조진의 부하입니다. 얼굴이 검고 눈이 누런빛을 띠었으며, 곰의 허리와 범의 등(웅요호배)을 지닌 건장한 체구였습니다. 60근 무게의 대도를 능숙하게 다루고 두 석 철태궁을 당겼으며, 세 개의 유성추를 품에 숨겨 지니고 다녔습니다. 제갈량의 2차 북벌 당시 조예에게 호위장군으로 임명되어 선봉으로 출진했습니다. 제갈량이 진창을 포위했을 때 원군으로 학소를 구원하러 가 촉나라 장수 사웅과 공기를 참살하고 대장 장억에게도 큰 중상을 입혔습니다. 그러나 이후 제갈량의 유인책에 넘어가 지나치게 깊이 추격했다가, 퇴각하려던 찰나 위연에게 베였습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10221","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"双","nameTc":"雙","nameEn":"Shuang","nameJp":"双","nameKr":"쌍","nameOther":"","word":"子全","wordTc":"子全","wordEn":"Ziquan","wordJp":"子全","wordKr":"자전","wordOther":"","icon":"王双","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"219","city":"CS1002","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"88","wise":"19","politics":"22","charm":"59","wi